WEBVTT

00:00:00.313 --> 00:00:01.046
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.019 --> 00:00:05.693
<v><b>M:</b></v> I think we need to prioritize discussing the budget, as it’s currently more urgent.

00:00:07.373 --> 00:00:08.066
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:09.187 --> 00:00:10.952
<v><b>M:</b></v> To scientists’ surprise,

00:00:11.032 --> 00:00:15.871
the 30-year study revealed no correlation between a vegan diet and good health.

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:18.528
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:19.448 --> 00:00:22.985
<v><b>M:</b></v> The writer claims to be the first to investigate this connection.

00:00:24.653 --> 00:00:25.513
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.607
<v><b>M:</b></v> The popularity of live TV has significantly decreased over the last ten years,

00:00:31.753 --> 00:00:33.993
as people move to streaming services.

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:36.618
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:37.611 --> 00:00:43.585
<v><b>M:</b></v> The study has concluded that a larger brain doesn’t necessarily make an animal more intelligent.

00:00:45.318 --> 00:00:46.263
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:47.257 --> 00:00:49.169
<v><b>F:</b></v> After years of steady improvement,

00:00:49.343 --> 00:00:54.653
driving test pass rates peaked at 60%, and have been dropping over the past few years.

00:00:56.373 --> 00:00:57.293
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:58.133 --> 00:01:03.591
<v><b>F:</b></v> We’re expecting house prices to rise by approximately 7%, but then to fall again.

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:05.995
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:01:07.034 --> 00:01:12.172
<v><b>F:</b></v> Before we publish the results in our paper, we will need to analyse our research in detail.